      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Caricature 3: Intent Ingestor\n\nBefore activating: run supabase/migration.sql and fill the campaign_config row.\n\nWebhooks: ia-track (website snippet, GET, no auth), caricature-instantly (Instantly webhook, all events), caricature-factors (account visits), caricature-maya (optional).\n\nAdd website/tracking-snippet.html to the site with ENDPOINT set to the ia-track production URL.\n\nCredentials: Supabase API, HubSpot App Token, Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <Instantly key>`, Slack API, Header Auth secrets for the Instantly, Factors and Maya webhooks.\n\nFull guide: caricature-campaign/docs/setup.md in github.com/sashank-and-sales-gtme/gtm-engineering-portfolio",
